  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">완두는 서늘한 기후를 좋아해서 이른 봄에 심어 한여름이 되기 전에 수확한다고 합니다만<br><br>입추를 기점으로 한더위는 넘었으니 해보자 해서 <br>가을재배에 도전해보았습니다.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c70e524dea4989ea9559f09a39c120963c98d46\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1960\" style=\"width:80.89%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c70e524dea4989ea9559f09a39c120963c98d46\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a907ae417d39423ac985b01bc3fb6887631d741\" data-origin-width=\"1960\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:19.11%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a907ae417d39423ac985b01bc3fb6887631d741\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95f50eb24779b145d44b0d6703368334bc83359c\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1960\" style=\"width:44.72%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95f50eb24779b145d44b0d6703368334bc83359c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1f24f13fc0e4eb64e69527b9e3f50fc571e8ec7\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1960\" style=\"width:44.72%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1f24f13fc0e4eb64e69527b9e3f50fc571e8ec7\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf26befbaddda69198da6303ffc8ff7d82c65390\" data-origin-width=\"1960\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:10.57%; margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf26befbaddda69198da6303ffc8ff7d82c65390\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\">불려서 싹틔우고 종이컵에 키우다가 옮겨심었어요.(9월)</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>가을재배는 서늘해서 여름처럼 흙이 잘 마르지 않으니 물주는 주기가 길어지더군요.<br></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a552da58e3efa817837b3dda3dd30fd2ec71602\" data-origin-width=\"1960\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:16.05%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a552da58e3efa817837b3dda3dd30fd2ec71602\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b5beb20d7746e5347de5c043c72c47261818a8b\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1960\" style=\"width:67.91%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b5beb20d7746e5347de5c043c72c47261818a8b\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f137bd39a021d3f17920e79e077ba4f4d797d32b\" data-origin-width=\"1960\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:16.05%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f137bd39a021d3f17920e79e077ba4f4d797d32b\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\">10월말에는 꽃이 피기 시작</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>11월 초에 갑자기 영하로 추위가 와서 급히 온실을 사서 설치해줬습니다.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af79ea87d19b2ab0f34082dc708ba12a066f0093\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"1960\" style=\"width:80.89%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/af79ea87d19b2ab0f34082dc708ba12a066f0093\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd1c9240a882595bb9eb3e2f50fc486fd49832eb\" data-origin-width=\"1960\" data-origin-height=\"4032\" style=\"width:19.11%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd1c9240a882595bb9eb3e2f50fc486fd49832eb\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\">11월 중순</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">일교차가 크고 습하니 흰가루병이라는 곰팡이 병이 생기더군요.. 그래서 마요네즈희석액으로 방제를 하며 견디고 있었습니다.<br>그러다가 12월.. 수확이 얼마 남지 않았고 꼬투리들이 너무 너무 잘 영글어 가고 있었는데 너무 추워진 나머지 꼬투리들이 얼어버렸습니다ㅠ<br><br>얼어죽지 않은 꼬투리 몇 개를 줄기째로 잘라 물에 꽂아서 키웠습니다.<br><br>물에 꽂아 키우니 키우던 종자 일부는 포기해버리고 한 꼬투리에 1~4개의 종자가 자랐습니다. 아무래도 힘들었나봐요. 건강한 꼬투리였으면 한 꼬투리에 6~8개의 종자가 들었을텐데 말이에요..ㅠ<br><br>어쨌든 너무나 궁금했던 잡종2대의 결과!</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b5cfb2a8e2b32db99fb108a6bb47ecc309bca2c\" data-origin-width=\"1500\" data-origin-height=\"1044\" style=\"width:34.72%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b5cfb2a8e2b32db99fb108a6bb47ecc309bca2c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e7567266c6b3c2feffc2ab6ff7301a51e12f0a7\" data-origin-width=\"1466\" data-origin-height=\"812\" style=\"width:43.63%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e7567266c6b3c2feffc2ab6ff7301a51e12f0a7\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ad970982e6abaadaf997d58245770ac300ad91c\" data-origin-width=\"1071\" data-origin-height=\"1196\" style=\"width:21.64%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ad970982e6abaadaf997d58245770ac300ad91c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>노랑 : 초록 = 18 : 10 로 나왔습니다.ㅎ<br><br>23년도 봄에는 제대로 키워서 모양과 색 모두 많은 종자들로 통계를 내보려고 합니다.^^<br><br>한 꼬투리에서 노랑과 초록이 3:1로 나오는 행운도 있었네요!^^<br><br><br>함께 해주신 모든 선생님들 감사합니다♡</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16d768dd1df55478a8c06e524dda460bf6d1d261\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16d768dd1df55478a8c06e524dda460bf6d1d261\" data-origin-width=\"1457\" data-origin-height=\"855\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
